Problem 5
✏️ Steps / Flow
Set one pointer at the beginning of the string.
Set another pointer at the end of the string.
Compare both characters.
If they are different, return false.
Move both pointers toward the center.
If all characters match, return true.

START

Input string s

left = 0
right = length(s) - 1

WHILE left < right
    IF s[left] ≠ s[right] THEN
        Return False
    END IF

    left = left + 1
    right = right - 1
END WHILE

Return True

STOP
